  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reparations and redress for victims of conflict-related sexual violence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the Global Survivors Fund is to enhance survivors of conflict-related sexual violence access to reparations and other forms of redress, globally, including where the states or other parties responsible for the violence are unwilling or unable to providing reparations.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
